#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat räägib su keelt. Selle inimesele suunatud tekst — vead, `doctor`-i ja "
"`status`-i väljatrükid, `--help` ekraanid — on tõlgitud **kõigisse 28 NATO "
"liikmesriigi keelde pluss ukraina keelde**."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Keele valimine"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat valib keele selles järjekorras:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "lipp `--lang` (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "keskkonnamuutuja `GOAT_LANG` (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "su operatsioonisüsteemi lokaat,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "inglise keel."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# ainult see käsk, saksa keeles\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# kõik, prantsuse keeles, selle kestaseansi jaoks\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Inglise keel on autoriteetne allikas: kui fraasi pole veel tõlgitud, näitab "
"goat tühja asemel inglise keelt."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Mis jääb igas keeles samaks"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"**Masinpind ei muutu kunagi.** `--json` väljaväärtused, veakoodid "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), väljumiskoodid, käskude ja lippude nimed ning lepingu-"
"tokenid (teed, võtmed, URL-id) on bait-baidilt identsed olenemata keelest. "
"Tõlgi proosa, mitte leping — nii töötavad su skriptid iga operaatori jaoks "
"ühtemoodi."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "Märkus masintõlgitud teksti kohta"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"Enamik tõlkeid on masinaga loodud ja ootavad emakeelekõneleja ülevaatust. "
"Kui käivitad goati ühes neist keeltest, trükib see standardveale lühikese "
"ühekordse teate, et tekst on masintõlgitud, et inglise keel on autoriteetne "
"ja kuhu tõlkeviga teatada. Summuta see käsuga `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Kui räägid üht neist keeltest ja märkad midagi valesti, on selline teade "
"tõeliselt teretulnud — just nii muutuvad kataloogid paremaks."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "Ja üks lõbu pärast"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` esitab juhtread **klingoni keeles**. See on valikuline "
"lihavõttemuna — kunagi ei valita automaatselt — ja nagu iga teine lokaat, ei "
"saa see masinpinda puudutada. Qapla'."

