msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"Iga ebaõnnestunud samm väljub eraldiseisva koodiga, nii et ümbrisskript saab "
"hargneda teksti parsimata."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Sagedased olukorrad"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Sa ei ole fabricu võrgus. "
"Käivita oma mesh-tunnel ja proovi uuesti; `goat doctor` kinnitab, kui oled "
"sees."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Su identiteet on "
"vananenud. `goat profile show`, et näha selle aegumist; kui see on möödunud, "
"vajad uut komplekti."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Su juurdepääsutõend pole enam "
"kehtiv (aegunud või tühistatud). Palu oma administraatoril end uuesti liita."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` näitab `[✗]`** `status` on ühe pilguga vaade; käivita `goat "
"doctor` astmelise üksikasja ja konkreetse lahenduse jaoks."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` näitab `ztol` rohelisena, aga `session` punasena** Ruuteri port võtab ühendusi vastu, kuid Zenoh seanss ei avane: ruuter on kinni jäänud või lükkab teie sertifikaadi tagasi. Mesh-ühenduse taaskäivitamine seda ei paranda. Käivitage `goat doctor` ja teavitage oma administraatorit."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "Veakoodi mõistmine"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr ""
"Iga viga kannab stabiilset koodi (nagu `E_OFF_MESH`). Et seda üles otsida:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Harjuta riskivabalt"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Kui tahad lihtsalt käske uurida ilma midagi pärisasja puudutamata, on "
"liivakast alati olemas:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "Ikka kinni?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Jäädvusta täpne käsk ja selle väljund (kasuta `--json` puhta, täieliku kirje "
"jaoks) ning vii see oma goat-administraatori juurde."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` on operaatori liides: osalejate lisamine ja eemaldamine, "
"sertifikaatide rotatsioon, valesti käituva peeri eemaldamine võrgust, "
"seadmete ettevalmistamine ja LAN-poolne triaaž. See on tavaliste käskudest "
"teadlikult eraldi."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Ainult operaatoritele.** Need käsud on operaatoritele, kellel on "
"adminõigused. Kui oled osaleja, kes publitseerib ja tellib andmeid fabrikus, "
"siis see peatükk ei ole su igapäevane tööriietus — su liides on "
"**[Igapäevased toimingud](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / "
"`who` / `health`). `goat admin` on **mitteadminidele inertne**: volitamata "
"väljakutse ei muuda midagi ja teatab sellest."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Mida \"ainult operaatoritele\" praktikas tähendab"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"Volitus ei ole CLI-s — see on _sinu mandaatides_. `goat` ise on õhuke "
"klient; kas sa võid organisatsiooni lisada või peeri välja arvata, "
"otsustatakse selle järgi, mida sinu operaatoriprofiil ja keskkond "
"sisaldavad, ning kinnitab portaal ja NetBirdi haldus-API. Seega võib "
"adminkäsk peatuda kahes õiges kohas:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**Alguses, enne millegi saatmist.** Kui sinu masinal ei ole üldse operaatori "
"seadistust — puudub lähtestatud profiil ja operaaatorkeskkond — keeldub "
"`goat admin` kohe koodiga `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Sinu sülearvutist ei lahku midagi."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Serveripoolselt, toimingu juures.** Kui sul on mandaadid, kuid need ei ole "
"selle toimingu jaoks volitatud, tagastab portaal või NetBird keeldumise. "
"Keeldutud _mutatsioon_ tähendab, et midagi ei muutunud — ja `goat` "
"raporteerib seda kui `E_NOT_ADMIN`, mitte ebamäärase tokeniveana."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "Kaks veakoodi, mida tasub eristada:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kood"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Tähendus"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Mida teha"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Sinu mandaat on **kehtiv, kuid ei ole selle toimingu jaoks volitatud** (või "
"operaatormandaat puudub)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolli, et kasutad oma operaatoriprofiili ja oled operaaatorkeskkonna "
"sisse laadinud. Kui ikka ei õnnestu, ei kuulu see toiming sinu rolli — võta "
"ühendust oma goat-administraatoriga. Uuesti lisamine seda ei muuda."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Sinu mandaat on **aegunud või vigane** (HTTP 401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Tee uuesti lisamine värske tokeni saamiseks."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Adminiinfo lugemine ei ole kunagi piiratud: `goat admin --help` ja `goat "
"admin <cmd> --help` töötavad alati, igas keeles. Kontrollitakse ainult "
"toimingu _käivitamist_."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "Käsud"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Lisa `--help` mis tahes käsu juurde täieliku lipukomplekti saamiseks või "
"vaata **[Käskude viidet](reference.md)** — seal olevad üksikasjad "
"genereeritakse binaarfailist, seega vastavad alati sellele, mida sa käitad."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "Mõned märkused:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` on hädaolukorra diagnostika.** `scan` ja `doctor` ei muuda midagi, "
"ei vaja mandaate ning on ehitatud töötama siis, kui võrk ja kõik teenused on "
"maas — seega on need ainus osa `goat admin`ist, mida puuduva "
"operaaatorkeskkonna korral ei keelata."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` hoiab identiteedi muutumatuna.** See annab lehtsertifikaadi "
"uuesti välja samale ankrule, aliasele, kirjutamisnimeruum ile ja ACL-ile — "
"ainult sert ja võti on uued. Kasuta seda uuendamiseks või võtme "
"vahetamiseks, mitte kellegi identiteedi muutmiseks."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` on tegelik lõikamine.** Maaklerile mittevajuvas fabrikus on "
"sertifikaat ilma võrguteta inertne, seega on _peeri_ eemaldamine see, mis "
"peatab ülekoormaja — `goat health` leiab selle, `goat admin peer cut` arvab "
"selle välja."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Hävitavad toimingud küsivad enne kinnitust.** `org delete`, `peer cut` "
"ja `--org` kaskaadid prindivad, mida nad teha kavatsevad, ja küsivad enne "
"toimingut (`--yes` vahelejätmiseks, `--dry-run` eelvaateks)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Kui näed `E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Midagi ei muudetud. Kontrolli järjekorras:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Kas kasutad oma operaatoriprofiili?** `goat context use <name>` valib "
"selle; `goat profile show` kinnitab, milline on aktiivne."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Kas oled operaaatorkeskkonna sisse laadinud?** Admintoimingud loevad "
"operaatormandaate keskkonnast (näiteks `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` ja NetBirdi "
"admintoken) — mitte kettalt profiililt."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Kas sul peaks üldse see ligipääs olema?** Kui oled eelneva kontrollinud ja "
"portaal ikka keeldub, ei ole sinu roll selle toimingu jaoks volitatud. Võta "
"ühendust oma goat-administraatoriga — sama identiteedi uuesti lisamine ei "
"anna seda õigust."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Täielik operaatori töövoog"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"See peatükk orienteerib sind liidese ja selle käitumise suhtes. Täielik "
"operaatori töövoog — võimekusmudel, keskkonna ja sertifikaatide seadistamine "
"ning lisamine / tühistamine / rotatsioon / auditeerimise tsükkel — asub "
"**admin-operaatori juhendis**, mis on kaasas sinu goatneti "
"operatsioonidokumentatsiooniga, mitte selles raamatus."

