#: src/concepts.md:9
msgid ""
"You join with an **identity**: an onboarding _bundle_ that carries your "
"certificate, an access token, and where the fabric lives. The fabric admits "
"you by _who you are_, not by a shared password. `goat ca add <bundle-"
"ca.pem>` tells goat which CA to trust — it ships trusting none — and `goat "
"profile init <bundle.cbor>` then installs that identity; you can hold "
"several under different _contexts_ and switch between them."
msgstr ""
"Liitute **identiteediga**: liitumis-_pakiga_, mis kannab teie sertifikaati, juurdepääsutokenit ja seda, kus fabric asub. Fabric võtab teid vastu selle järgi, _kes te olete_, mitte jagatud parooli järgi. `goat ca add <bundle-ca.pem>` ütleb goatile, millist CA-d usaldada — see tarnitakse ühtegi usaldamata — ja `goat profile init <bundle.cbor>` paigaldab seejärel selle identiteedi; võite hoida mitut erinevate _kontekstide_ all ja nende vahel vahetada."

#: src/getting-started.md:50
msgid ""
"The first line is not optional. `goat` ships trusting **no** goatnet, so "
"`profile init` refuses until you add the root that signed your bundle — the "
"`-ca.pem` ships beside the `.cbor` it verifies. `goat ca add` prints a "
"fingerprint; check it against one your operator gives you before relying on "
"it, because a bundle that reached you over a channel proves only that the "
"channel delivered it. `goat ca ls` shows what you trust; one binary works "
"against every goatnet whose root you have added."
msgstr ""
"Esimene rida ei ole valikuline. `goat` tarnitakse **ühtegi** goatneti usaldamata, seega `profile init` keeldub, kuni lisate juure, mis teie paki allkirjastas — `-ca.pem` tarnitakse selle `.cbor` kõrval, mida ta verifitseerib. `goat ca add` prindib sõrmejälje; võrrelge seda operaatorilt saaduga, enne kui sellele toetute, sest kanali kaudu teieni jõudnud pakk tõestab ainult seda, et kanal selle kohale toimetas. `goat ca ls` näitab, mida te usaldate; üks binaar töötab iga goatnetiga, mille juure olete lisanud."
